jobs.description:
Are you an experienced Reach Truck Driver looking for a new opportunity? We are currently recruiting for a modern logistics company in Helmond. As a Reach Truck Driver, you will be responsible for safely and efficiently moving goods throughout the warehouse while supporting daily logistics operations using modern equipment.

Your responsibilities:

- Operating a reach truck at heights of up to 12 meters;
- Moving and storing pallets throughout the warehouse;
- Picking orders using the reach truck;
- Scanning, labeling, and wrapping pallets;
- Checking orders before shipment;
- Supporting Value Added Services (VAS) activities;
- Maintaining a clean, safe, and organized working environment.

Working Hours in the day shift: 07:00 AM – 04:00 PM. During peak periods in July till October, a two-shift schedule may be required. (6:00-15:00/15:00-00:00)

- Holds a valid Reach Truck certificate;
- Is comfortable working at heights up to 12 meters;
- Fulltime available;
- Living nearby Helmond, Mierlo, Geldrop, Nuenen or Eindhoven;
- Has experience in logistics and safety;
- Is flexible regarding tasks and working hours;
- Has a good command of Dutch and/or English.

Do you enjoy working with data, reporting and partner coordination, while playing a key role behind the success of a regional sales organization? Then this opportunity in Rijswijk could be the right next step for you. Please note: visa sponsorship is not available for this position.

What are you going to do?
We are looking for a Channel & Sales Operations Coordinator to support our regional sales and partner operations team. In this role, you will combine performance reporting, data management, partner support and event coordination in an international environment where Mandarin and English are used on a daily basis.

Your daily tasks include:

- Support the full lifecycle of channel partners, including onboarding, registration, qualification, and certification;
- Maintain accurate partner and performance data, with a strong focus on data processing, compliance, and record quality;
- Collect, consolidate, and update regional sales and channel information for internal reporting purposes;
- Prepare weekly and monthly reports and briefings for the regional team and headquarters;
- Monitor business reviews, project processes, and operational compliance across sales and channel activities;
- Coordinate customer invitation lists, RSVP tracking, and event logistics for regional marketing events and business initiatives;
- Work closely with sales, marketing, and other internal departments to ensure efficient execution of business processes;

What do we offer?
- A yearcontract to start with, salary between €3,200 and €4,000 gross per month, depending on your experience;
- 24 vacation days to support a healthy work-life balance;
- An attractive bonus scheme and salary increases every six months based on performance;
- Access to an on-site gym and a modern company restaurant offering both Western and Asian meals;
- A dynamic and international working environment at a leading technology company;
- The opportunity to grow within marketing and develop your partner manage

What will you do?

Do you have an affinity for technology or experience in technical production, and are you handy with practical work? Are you also looking for a long-term job opportunity? Then look no further!

As a Field Service Technician, you will visit various organizations, ranging from large government institutions and universities to hospitals. The work requires specialized skills, for which you will receive internal training.

Your responsibilities include:

- Maintenance and renovation of air handling systems;
- Cleaning and gas-free preparation of installations within the chemical industry;
- Collaborating with various clients to ensure technical installations function optimally.

Who are you?

In addition to an interest in technology and technical insight, you have:

- A VCA certificate or willingness to obtain one;
- A valid Category B driving license;
- Strong communication skills, customer friendliness, and initiative;
- Good command of the English and/or Dutch language.
